{"id":"dedo","lemma":"dedo","pos":"noun","rank":1113,"glosses":["digit: finger or toe, literally translated as \"finger\" and thought of that way by Spanish-speaking learners of English","thimble (a small device to protect a thumb or finger during sewing)","finger (the width of a finger as an approximate unit of length)"],"ipa":"/ˈdedo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dedos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dedo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me corté el dedo.","en":"I cut my finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441511"},{"text":"¿Tienes los dedos rotos?","en":"Are your fingers broken?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/616283"},{"text":"Tomás perdió un dedo.","en":"Tom lost a finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448753"},{"text":"Estoy cruzando mis dedos.","en":"I'm crossing my fingers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608006"},{"text":"Me quemé el dedo.","en":"I burned my finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450434"}]}